name: sim.getObjectUid
description: Retrieves the unique identifier of an object: throughout a CoppeliaSim session, there won't be two identical unique identifiers. Unique identifiers are however not persistent (i.e. are not saved with the object)
luaSynopsis: int uid = sim.getObjectUid(int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int uid = sim.getObjectUid(int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: object handle
outputs:
1. uid: the unique identifier
